Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Abstract", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218099462522*^9, 
  3.9792181050063763`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3dc080c2-cce6-4817-a2dc-\
6249b340d407"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Kerr metric around a spinning black hole is much more difficult than \
the Schwarzschild metric. The quest to find and solve its field equations \
took some 50 years from Einstein\[CloseCurlyQuote]s publishing of general \
relativity in 1915. The ",
 StyleBox["dramatis",
  IgnoreSpellCheck->True,
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox[" personae",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " include Boyer, Lindquist, Kerr, Ernst, and others who published results \
from 1965 to 1968. We tell the story not historically, but as ",
 "a fable of challenge and victory",
 StyleBox[", in",
  FontWeight->"Regular"],
 " a spirit of rigorous fun. Along the way, we stress-test \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD] and the Relativity Toolkit, v1.10.0. \
That\[CloseCurlyQuote]s the novel contribution of this notebook."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJwdyE8og3EAh/G3SS1ZNA4jo8USrc0WEUubw1bK0iQh1BqWyxzXNGbLDqZE
yFgrbWYltR3s8IbatOJg/pbZgWRms0aoObj4fXd4+tTD0+jV4wyKoipJsIG5
sxbazcoV/HTe/eGUAwpN925otO+xrol+UboMlthjHPjQ8yOCwTqZAmYi8T4Y
0rbp89/QYoMGrmUFlg70euDnsusKOgSjz3CpXFN4QywOsDiwiKLlULwo7YLN
byr+C7Fbya6H2uPDEbjx26+DtlvZTILI+ihYgJZEKgo1vK+8jWyJ6ZXIFVrX
4dZJLgCjTnUQVgeraEiP+46gS3IZhuHaiVM47wkLkkTVk1EC5XMdq/DRndyG
m4PtsRRReZCLw5rzyYt3YlOnOAqHnH+WDHF2zG+FVNysa/Vm5elv8xQ8493p
IZspnYYVtNcLGcGID/4DtQzt/g==
  "],ExpressionUUID->"aafbfaad-d4ad-4821-827b-5be544be948a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Unlike static Schwarzschild, Kerr has off-diagonal terms that couple time \
and rotation: ",
 StyleBox["frame-dragging",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". Light cones near the black hole are tipped in the spin direction, \
dragging orbits out of the Keplerian plane. The effect is also called ",
 StyleBox["gravitomagnetism",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", due to its resemblance to electrodynamical magnetism, both producing \
stresses perpendicular to planes of motion. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.9792503561455803`*^9}, {3.979250406313347*^9, 
   3.979250464214533*^9}, {3.979250526904248*^9, 3.979250529904133*^9}, {
   3.979250806477247*^9, 3.9792508124431543`*^9}, {3.9792512061710463`*^9, 
   3.979251215056979*^9}, {3.9792517417694597`*^9, 3.979251743187923*^9}, {
   3.979286924869732*^9, 3.979287022481254*^9}, {3.979287054116839*^9, 
   3.979287056528462*^9}, {3.9792921521228113`*^9, 3.9792921775299664`*^9}, {
   3.9792922167166653`*^9, 3.9792922857980747`*^9}, {3.979292341083699*^9, 
   3.979292345378234*^9}, {3.9792923794165373`*^9, 3.979292404346846*^9}, {
   3.979292443437128*^9, 3.9792925489681253`*^9}, 3.979293089384967*^9, {
   3.979293937924892*^9, 
   3.9792940974979887`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f34d759b-8e35-4d18-9d65-\
c7e209bb4b38"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Over time, stable Kerr orbits trace out toroidal structures via nodal \
precession similar to that of a Lagrange top. This precession is additional \
to precession of the perihelion, present even in Schwarzschild (non-rotating) \
geometry. Kerr black holes also have ",
 StyleBox["Ergospheres",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", aka ",
 StyleBox["static limits",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", spacetime boundaries outside the event horizons. Inside an Ergosphere, \
spacetime itself flows faster than light. Inflowing geodesics are swept along \
the spinning direction of the black hole."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.9792503561455803`*^9}, {3.979250406313347*^9, 
   3.979250464214533*^9}, {3.979250526904248*^9, 3.979250529904133*^9}, {
   3.979250806477247*^9, 3.9792508124431543`*^9}, {3.9792512061710463`*^9, 
   3.979251215056979*^9}, {3.9792517417694597`*^9, 3.979251743187923*^9}, {
   3.979286924869732*^9, 3.979287022481254*^9}, {3.979287054116839*^9, 
   3.979287056528462*^9}, {3.9792921521228113`*^9, 3.9792921775299664`*^9}, {
   3.9792922167166653`*^9, 3.9792922857980747`*^9}, {3.979292341083699*^9, 
   3.979292345378234*^9}, {3.9792923794165373`*^9, 3.979292404346846*^9}, {
   3.979292443437128*^9, 3.9792925489681253`*^9}, 3.979293089384967*^9, {
   3.979293937924892*^9, 3.979294219525239*^9}, {3.979304505709181*^9, 
   3.979304506301462*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"811e68f6-cac6-405c-8e0b-\
9747122e9bb2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction: A Quest", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979251714184195*^9, 3.979251716835116*^9}, {
  3.9792887598867826`*^9, 
  3.9792887620315313`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"add37f9e-2eab-46a5-9d87-\
d65cdb289931"],

Cell["\<\
The Wizard Chandra reveals a quest: \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]I have an ancient \
artifact, a wondrous machine, more wondrous than Antikythera. I have \
partially translated its name: \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Visualizer.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] From what else I can gather, it shows orbits around \
a spinning black hole. I can make it do some things, but I can\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t operate it proficiently. Find out anything you can about \
it. Needless to say, I also don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t know how it works. Is it \
beyond hope to find the blueprints? Without them, I can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
replicate, maintain, or repair the machine. If it breaks, \
it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s lost forever! Let me show you what little I know.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.97925033483666*^9}, {3.979250553762299*^9, 
   3.979250737670985*^9}, {3.9792508280660973`*^9, 3.9792509785106277`*^9}, {
   3.97925133295507*^9, 3.979251466942944*^9}, {3.979251755065008*^9, 
   3.979251904427862*^9}, {3.979252237812505*^9, 3.979252241891869*^9}, {
   3.979286826465723*^9, 3.9792868405712023`*^9}, {3.979287277679369*^9, 
   3.979287367603675*^9}, {3.97928869667246*^9, 3.979289283877121*^9}, {
   3.979289316400536*^9, 3.979289361201816*^9}, {3.979289660777204*^9, 
   3.979289833523119*^9}, {3.97928986430659*^9, 3.97929003648954*^9}, {
   3.979290076268664*^9, 3.979290279347597*^9}, {3.979290351417584*^9, 
   3.97929037970683*^9}, {3.9792904347935953`*^9, 3.979290568197463*^9}, {
   3.979291350150494*^9, 3.9792914998855133`*^9}, {3.979294234305711*^9, 
   3.979294235277051*^9}, {3.979302396309739*^9, 3.9793024701762114`*^9}, {
   3.979303100138832*^9, 3.97930313053386*^9}, {3.979312366715281*^9, 
   3.979312373750779*^9}, 3.9793139080446367`*^9, {3.979429843654769*^9, 
   3.979430231899547*^9}, {3.9794309256372147`*^9, 3.979430973546423*^9}, {
   3.979460204326429*^9, 3.979460224184164*^9}, {3.979460622437284*^9, 
   3.979460644044694*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"44ebb89a-025c-4642-9f5a-9e8766bc8893"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "He shows us: ",
 StyleBox["The 3D Spirograph",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 ", wherein orbits fly up and down, out of the plane, but never escape a \
donut-shaped envelope; ",
 StyleBox["The Hula Hoop",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 ", wherein orbits become Schwarzschild\[LongDash]planar\[LongDash]when the \
black hole stops spinning; ",
 StyleBox["The Rip Tide",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 ", wherein stars dumped straight down into the black hole touch the \
Ergosphere and are swept aside and flung away. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.97925033483666*^9}, {3.979250553762299*^9, 
   3.979250737670985*^9}, {3.9792508280660973`*^9, 3.9792509785106277`*^9}, {
   3.97925133295507*^9, 3.979251466942944*^9}, {3.979251755065008*^9, 
   3.979251904427862*^9}, {3.979252237812505*^9, 3.979252241891869*^9}, {
   3.979286826465723*^9, 3.9792868405712023`*^9}, {3.979287277679369*^9, 
   3.979287367603675*^9}, {3.97928869667246*^9, 3.979289283877121*^9}, {
   3.979289316400536*^9, 3.979289361201816*^9}, {3.979289660777204*^9, 
   3.979289833523119*^9}, {3.97928986430659*^9, 3.97929003648954*^9}, {
   3.979290076268664*^9, 3.979290279347597*^9}, {3.979290351417584*^9, 
   3.97929037970683*^9}, {3.9792904347935953`*^9, 3.979290568197463*^9}, {
   3.979291350150494*^9, 3.9792914998855133`*^9}, {3.979294234305711*^9, 
   3.979294235277051*^9}, {3.979302396309739*^9, 3.9793024701762114`*^9}, {
   3.979303100138832*^9, 3.97930313053386*^9}, {3.979312366715281*^9, 
   3.979312373750779*^9}, 3.9793139080446367`*^9, {3.979429843654769*^9, 
   3.979430231899547*^9}, {3.9794309256372147`*^9, 3.979430973546423*^9}, {
   3.979460204326429*^9, 3.979460280537726*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"e1155513-8940-4427-bf8a-8ef6dea4c0b6"],

Cell["\<\
We look inside the machine. The clockwork is an indecipherable bloc of \
definitions. Our quest is to explain them. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.97925033483666*^9}, {3.979250553762299*^9, 
   3.979250737670985*^9}, {3.9792508280660973`*^9, 3.9792509785106277`*^9}, {
   3.97925133295507*^9, 3.979251466942944*^9}, {3.979251755065008*^9, 
   3.979251904427862*^9}, {3.979252237812505*^9, 3.979252241891869*^9}, {
   3.979286826465723*^9, 3.9792868405712023`*^9}, {3.979287277679369*^9, 
   3.979287367603675*^9}, {3.97928869667246*^9, 3.979289283877121*^9}, {
   3.979289316400536*^9, 3.979289364614991*^9}, {3.979289400421259*^9, 
   3.979289421664435*^9}, {3.979289481025236*^9, 3.9792895179215384`*^9}, {
   3.979290592642396*^9, 3.9792906109368362`*^9}, {3.97929069837016*^9, 
   3.979290715259185*^9}, {3.979290779140274*^9, 3.979290989440477*^9}, {
   3.979291021851308*^9, 3.979291032008389*^9}, 3.979291159243382*^9, {
   3.9792926221770067`*^9, 3.979292697564884*^9}, {3.979294292295882*^9, 
   3.9792943114192*^9}, {3.97930456485845*^9, 3.9793046046111593`*^9}, {
   3.9794302509836273`*^9, 3.979430312113257*^9}, {3.979430998787524*^9, 
   3.979431026233268*^9}, {3.979460288093491*^9, 3.97946031397971*^9}, {
   3.979460387075325*^9, 3.979460400695035*^9}, {3.9794606986666*^9, 
   3.9794607116229467`*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"5a276d62-d53b-4449-abc9-b8b3a4dffc48"],

Cell["\<\
To do that, the wizard says, we must find, decipher, and translate the keys \
that lie in forgotten tomes in a Great Library fabled to be at the end of a \
long road. The wizard gives us a partial map, a linearized far-field \
approximation. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.97925033483666*^9}, {3.979250553762299*^9, 
   3.979250737670985*^9}, {3.9792508280660973`*^9, 3.9792509785106277`*^9}, {
   3.97925133295507*^9, 3.979251466942944*^9}, {3.979251755065008*^9, 
   3.979251904427862*^9}, {3.979252237812505*^9, 3.979252241891869*^9}, {
   3.979286826465723*^9, 3.9792868405712023`*^9}, {3.979287277679369*^9, 
   3.979287367603675*^9}, {3.97928869667246*^9, 3.979289283877121*^9}, {
   3.979289316400536*^9, 3.979289364614991*^9}, {3.979289400421259*^9, 
   3.979289421664435*^9}, {3.979289481025236*^9, 3.9792895179215384`*^9}, {
   3.979290592642396*^9, 3.9792906109368362`*^9}, {3.97929069837016*^9, 
   3.979290715259185*^9}, {3.979290779140274*^9, 3.979290989440477*^9}, {
   3.979291021851308*^9, 3.979291032008389*^9}, 3.979291159243382*^9, {
   3.9792926221770067`*^9, 3.979292697564884*^9}, {3.979294292295882*^9, 
   3.9792943114192*^9}, {3.97930456485845*^9, 3.9793046046111593`*^9}, {
   3.9794302509836273`*^9, 3.979430312113257*^9}, {3.979430998787524*^9, 
   3.979431026233268*^9}, {3.979460288093491*^9, 3.97946031397971*^9}, {
   3.979460387075325*^9, 3.979460400695035*^9}, {3.9794606986666*^9, 
   3.979460701399074*^9}, {3.979460734781377*^9, 3.9794608482045717`*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"d5dce90c-7af7-4443-98fd-dcb0f85df6eb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The wizard warns us that a dragon named ",
 StyleBox["Ansatz Kerr",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 " blocks the road. To look the ansatz field equations in the eye will drive \
a knight to madness. But, the wizard gives us pieces of a Magical Sword, ",
 StyleBox["Ernst",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 ", that he thinks might help us. These pieces are new compiler functions in \
the ",
 StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 " Relativity Toolkit. We write down more of the wizard\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
guide for our quest journey:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979218085032246*^9, 3.9792180872858*^9}, {
   3.97921812726119*^9, 3.9792182067340307`*^9}, {3.979249773235776*^9, 
   3.979249823287071*^9}, {3.979249862766975*^9, 3.979250047603253*^9}, {
   3.9792502260044813`*^9, 3.97925033483666*^9}, {3.979250553762299*^9, 
   3.979250737670985*^9}, {3.9792508280660973`*^9, 3.9792509785106277`*^9}, {
   3.97925133295507*^9, 3.979251466942944*^9}, {3.979251755065008*^9, 
   3.979251904427862*^9}, {3.979252237812505*^9, 3.979252241891869*^9}, {
   3.979286826465723*^9, 3.9792868405712023`*^9}, {3.979287277679369*^9, 
   3.979287367603675*^9}, {3.97928869667246*^9, 3.979289283877121*^9}, {
   3.979289316400536*^9, 3.979289364614991*^9}, {3.979289400421259*^9, 
   3.979289421664435*^9}, {3.979289481025236*^9, 3.9792895179215384`*^9}, {
   3.979290592642396*^9, 3.9792906109368362`*^9}, {3.97929069837016*^9, 
   3.979290715259185*^9}, {3.979290779140274*^9, 3.979290989440477*^9}, {
   3.979291021851308*^9, 3.979291032008389*^9}, 3.979291159243382*^9, {
   3.9792926221770067`*^9, 3.979292697564884*^9}, {3.979294292295882*^9, 
   3.9792943114192*^9}, {3.97930456485845*^9, 3.9793046046111593`*^9}, {
   3.9794302509836273`*^9, 3.979430446908259*^9}, {3.979430554918847*^9, 
   3.979430568007186*^9}, {3.979430622616132*^9, 3.9794306330292892`*^9}, {
   3.9794310527708683`*^9, 3.979431064551878*^9}, {3.979460421104293*^9, 
   3.979460571954433*^9}, {3.9794608768990192`*^9, 3.979460892054388*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"eddffa10-cbe5-416c-b505-8932ebcbd164"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Dragon",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": ",
 "We write the Einstein vacuum field equations, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Ricci", "=", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"958a507b-94a8-4884-8016-b850a674bedb"],
 ", over an ansatz metric of four diagonal components, as we did with \
Schwarzschild, but this time including a fifth, coupling term, conjured \
intuitively, in the two, symmetrical, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"t", "\[LongDash]", "\[Phi]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"aa579ff5-66a4-435a-a801-c5217afbfeca"],
 " slots. "
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979251007818901*^9, 3.979251320659028*^9}, {
  3.97925148152369*^9, 3.979251508366983*^9}, {3.979251923044775*^9, 
  3.9792519343597393`*^9}, {3.979252279203951*^9, 3.979252288972143*^9}, {
  3.979287426778748*^9, 3.979287517836838*^9}, {3.979291065028103*^9, 
  3.979291099673541*^9}, {3.979292730205348*^9, 3.979292731034466*^9}, {
  3.97929434331606*^9, 3.979294364058465*^9}, {3.97931246130066*^9, 
  3.979312461517189*^9}, {3.979430462701879*^9, 
  3.9794305343786697`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4323d688-c089-4906-af46-\
ac307b86e24a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Thorny Thicket",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": While the equations are easy for \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] to \
write, they are a stupendously large, thorny thicket of algebra on either \
side of the dragon, with 300-800 terms each. ",
 StyleBox["No opening has ever been found, the wizard tells us.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " There is no obvious structure amongst the enormity, no starting point for \
teasing the equations apart and solving them incrementally. (TODO: perhaps AI \
can take a stab at solving them; I didn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t try it.)"
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979251007818901*^9, 3.979251320659028*^9}, {
  3.97925148152369*^9, 3.979251508366983*^9}, {3.979251923044775*^9, 
  3.9792519343597393`*^9}, {3.979252279203951*^9, 3.979252288972143*^9}, {
  3.979287426778748*^9, 3.979287517836838*^9}, {3.979291065028103*^9, 
  3.979291099673541*^9}, {3.979292730205348*^9, 3.979292731034466*^9}, {
  3.97929434331606*^9, 3.979294364058465*^9}, {3.97931246130066*^9, 
  3.979312461517189*^9}, {3.979430462701879*^9, 3.9794305446587753`*^9}, {
  3.979430585549118*^9, 3.9794306059086933`*^9}, {3.9794612442500668`*^9, 
  3.9794612468272257`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d8fa8abc-0e95-462d-93e6-\
5c48b0c8b3f8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Wizard\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Map",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": ",
 StyleBox["Are we on the right road?",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " The map is a new, simplified, linearized, weak-field, far-field ansatz \
that yields Newton-Kepler with light frame-dragging. ",
 StyleBox["The map will show us when we are on the right road, with the \
promise that the keys we seek lie beyond the dragon. But we can\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t slay the dragon, and we can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t step \
around him because he is surrounded by the impenetrable thicket as far as the \
eye can see.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97925152622043*^9, 3.979251620867999*^9}, {
   3.979252296929006*^9, 3.979252333433988*^9}, {3.979288131337208*^9, 
   3.979288134935541*^9}, 3.97929113777874*^9, {3.979294396581807*^9, 
   3.979294413848153*^9}, {3.9793046453397627`*^9, 3.979304692935264*^9}, {
   3.9794306513005733`*^9, 3.979430722273966*^9}, {3.979461286785885*^9, 
   3.979461323427074*^9}, {3.979461366082181*^9, 
   3.97946136632627*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bc872cd8-0dfa-4b41-a534-\
1a8541df9a75"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Magical Sword",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": ",
 StyleBox["a sword named ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Ernst",
 StyleBox[" may help us. If we can find the jewels in the thicket, we can \
slot them into the empty hilt of the sword and, by shining sunlight through \
them, enchant the monster into letting us pass. ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Ernst gives us a simplified equation that the Kerr metric must satisfy. ",
 StyleBox["The jewels will write the equation in ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]",
 StyleBox[" and recapitulate Ernst\[CloseCurlyQuote]s proof. ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9792516385762997`*^9, 3.979251687025613*^9}, {
  3.9792519796903677`*^9, 3.979252008030642*^9}, {3.979291178121875*^9, 
  3.979291221022523*^9}, {3.9793044070414133`*^9, 3.979304470588736*^9}, {
  3.97930469929694*^9, 3.979304699673975*^9}, {3.979305540021379*^9, 
  3.979305615386142*^9}, {3.9793126213875637`*^9, 3.9793126276288757`*^9}, {
  3.979430729446191*^9, 3.979430838970501*^9}, {3.979461392677486*^9, 
  3.979461393655129*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1942e9f8-644a-4383-9f81-\
74a98d4f37bb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Road Beyond",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Now with the full metric revealed, we compare it to the Wolfram Function \
Repository (WFR) and find a match. ",
 StyleBox["This will be the detailed map to the Great Library.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979252029129222*^9, 3.979252101520535*^9}, {
  3.979294430318396*^9, 3.9792944305030003`*^9}, {3.979430851261945*^9, 
  3.9794308911710463`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"40c3728d-3214-4fc7-b891-\
57d99e3ea25b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Quest Achieved",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Should we succeed, we will find the vacuum equations now tractable, \
symbolically and numerically, and show how they\[CloseCurlyQuote]re built \
into the Visualizer. We now can explain, in detail, The 3D Spirograph, The \
Hula Hoop, The Rip Tide. "
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979252107590763*^9, 3.979252160777254*^9}, {
  3.979252364254335*^9, 3.9792524202055283`*^9}, {3.979291235816399*^9, 
  3.9792912901940403`*^9}, {3.979291323345975*^9, 3.979291335583846*^9}, {
  3.979430896542158*^9, 3.979430917431896*^9}, {3.979431087649871*^9, 
  3.979431092904833*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"39be23d5-fa6e-4e6e-af75-\
466424bfbefc"],

Cell["\<\
Before we set out, the wizard fully provisions us for the quest.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979304799181602*^9, 3.979304811369163*^9}, {
  3.979305474341236*^9, 3.97930547529493*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"ae4f5af6-cba7-45b6-aa4d-1fe02b5dc9a9"]
}, Open  ]],

