d3f2649257a1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Angular momentum is measured in meters. The slider measures ",
 StyleBox["specific spin angular momentum",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " of the black hole, normalized to the mass (in meters) of the black hole. \
Larger values mean faster spinning. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979459150250842*^9, 3.9794592817090807`*^9}, {
   3.9794640064386463`*^9, 3.979464089419714*^9}, {3.9794641275441027`*^9, 
