   3.9794356580125647`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e2978577-0ccd-4ea4-aeee-\
f6cc55e23c37"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "How long, in proper time, does a duration setting of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["1000", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "129ab18a-137d-4aa5-90b3-aadd1a44e10d"],
 " last? Because of time dilation, a journey of duration = 1000 for the \
astronaut might take much longer for a distant observer. The Visualizer plots \
the path for a set amount of time experienced by an astronaut riding on the \
path."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979435667901157*^9, 3.9794356772487497`*^9}, {
  3.9794357331877203`*^9, 3.979435749663611*^9}, {3.979435784849039*^9, 
  3.979435851439863*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bcb0c440-fe9c-43cd-a1df-\
c996e896bbbd"],

