57e94a632b20"],

Cell["\<\
In this bookmarked visualization, we have a situation where Newtonian \
intuition breaks down.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.979299329667094*^9}, {
   3.979299594622752*^9, 3.979299597358303*^9}, {3.979300901074252*^9, 
   3.9793009032694473`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3db82635-2b44-4d7a-9177-\
b18bfed14512"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Setup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": a test particle at radius 1.8, inside the orange Ergosphere ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"r", " ", "<", " ", "2.0"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b9f8b131-1b95-453f-89b9-6d8ef4f5ff13"],
 " but outside the black event horizon ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"r", "\[TildeTilde]", "1.14"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "9c747400-9383-44da-81b8-d14ecd257060"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.979299432971806*^9}, {
   3.979301114142531*^9, 
   3.979301147822546*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d13aa170-17c2-4714-95ed-\
b8778845c508"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Drop",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": zero angular momentum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Ang", " ", "Mom"}], " ", "=", " ", "0"}], ")"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a64ba896-2288-43de-8f07-e9ac96608dce"],
 ". In a Newtonian universe (or far from the black hole), a rock droped zero \
angular momentum falls straight into the center of gravity, like a stone \
dropped from a tower."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995390786123`*^9}, 
   3.979301159803471*^9},ExpressionUUID->"bcab5303-0287-4f4f-b372-\
3dd75f75ff53"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The Deadly Fate",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": The red trail does not fall straight in. Instead, it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
violently ripped around the black hole in a spiral before plunging in."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995847035227`*^9}, {
   3.9792996149983797`*^9, 
   3.9792996209501762`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"24daca3f-788c-4aaf-a183-\
378809800f53"],

Cell["\<\
This illustrates the Lense-Thirring effect (frame-dragging) at its extreme.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995847035227`*^9}, {
   3.979299629815482*^9, 3.979299651463599*^9}, 3.979299702646494*^9, {
   3.9793011634886427`*^9, 
   3.979301164046462*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e667a5e8-0f23-4616-98fa-\
ce32c1341abc"],

Cell["\<\
Inside the orange shell\[LongDash]the Ergosphere\[LongDash]the spin of the \
black hole drags spacetime along with it so fast that space itself move at \
the speed of light relative to a distant observer.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995847035227`*^9}, {
   3.979299629815482*^9, 3.979299651463599*^9}, {3.979299707414598*^9, 
   3.97929974682625*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"25353353-2cb7-4c7e-b5aa-\
c54c4c3813ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The boundary of the Ergosphere is the ",
 StyleBox["static limit",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". Inside this boundary, it is impossible to remain \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]static,\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] at a constant \
longitude \[Phi]. To stand still here would require moving against the flow \
of space faster than light."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995847035227`*^9}, {
   3.979299629815482*^9, 3.979299651463599*^9}, {3.979299707414598*^9, 
   3.979299814200667*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"05363ca3-d8a1-4022-82b6-\
6167f2094d43"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Even though the particle has zero angular momentum\[LongDash]it\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s trying to fall straight in\[LongDash]any ",
 StyleBox["coordinate grid",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " the particle lives on is rotating. The effect is intrinsic to the \
geometry. No non-singular coordinate system (gauge choice) can get rid of it. \
The particle is swept downstream by the rip tide of spacetime. It is forced \
to co-rotate with the black hole, no matter how hard it resists."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995847035227`*^9}, {
   3.979299629815482*^9, 3.979299651463599*^9}, {3.979299707414598*^9, 
   3.979299959076558*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6d9154c1-0823-4a5e-8cf3-\
8c6ca64cbc57"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The code turns the track red because the particle is inside the danger zone \
(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"r", "<", "2.1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "1db0f4a5-e68e-4685-9712-9ea477d69859"],
 "). It shows the particle being digested\[LongDash]forced into rotation and \
eventually swallowed beyond the horizon."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979299134328352*^9, {3.979299316417794*^9, 3.9792995847035227`*^9}, {
   3.979299629815482*^9, 3.979299651463599*^9}, {3.979299707414598*^9, 
   3.9792999264844007`*^9}, {3.979299967788947*^9, 
   3.9793000109974127`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8d69ec11-2153-469c-afda-\
b07c5688cd39"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Dragon: Kerr Metric ",
 StyleBox["ab-initio",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979076248544854*^9, 3.9790762552466793`*^9}, {
  3.979295097171152*^9, 
  3.97929510089356*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"430592b7-dd2c-43da-8a3a-\
ee22831cdae1"],

Cell["\<\
The Wizard Chandra warned us: \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Do not look the dragon, \
Ansatz Kerr, in the eye, for his gaze is madness.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] But \
being brave (foolhardy?), we go straight into the breach. The elder dragon, \
Ansatz Schwarzschild, yielded to a frontal attack, after all. Why not Ansatz \
Kerr?\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979303195387826*^9, 3.979303360285076*^9}, {
   3.979303829538443*^9, 3.979303842436769*^9}, {3.979304836545615*^9, 
   3.979304856834509*^9}, 3.9793078562563133`*^9, {3.979312925823854*^9, 
   3.979312928250888*^9}, 3.9793139522690763`*^9, {3.9794619823025627`*^9, 
   3.97946200678231*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"d2cadd0c-2b0e-4d36-aeac-b12c0f3bf77d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["We make a trap\[LongDash]an ansatz metric. The beast is \
stationary, sleeping, unchanging in time. He is also axisymmetric, appearing \
the same from any angle around its spin axis. For the other sleeping dragon, \
Ansatz Schwarzschild, a diagonal metric sufficed. But this dragon, Ansatz \
Kerr, spins. To trap it, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "we must add a twist: a cross-term, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["E", "rot"], "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0394d821-16c7-41ae-85ad-7df0803424ed"],
 ", linking time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["t", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4405be27-1d99-4e7a-addf-7f0d1be35d43"],
 " and azimuth \[Phi]. This is the mathematical embodiment of \
frame-dragging."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979303195387826*^9, {3.979303362914062*^9, 3.979303496662524*^9}, {
   3.9793048662585077`*^9, 3.9793049467033653`*^9}, {3.979305772216477*^9, 
   3.979305786574443*^9}, {3.9793129733045177`*^9, 3.979312976390525*^9}, {
   3.9794322039319067`*^9, 3.9794322051896343`*^9}, {3.979462038561779*^9, 
   3.979462084831977*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c23c0f7b-5dbc-44bd-8d48-\
b0439f2470d9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We cast our net (the ansatz metric) and bind it with the Einstein vacuum \
field equations: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["R", 
     RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
      RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[Nu]"}]}]], "=", "0"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"e1b7fa71-fa35-4701-95c4-85aafa0a5b0b"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979303195387826*^9, {3.979303362914062*^9, 3.979303579072974*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"4ca22349-706a-46d9-800b-893d2d66898d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] Toolkit",
  FontSlant->"Plain"],
 ", faithful squire, does the dirty work. It calculates the Christoffel \
symbols and the Riemann curvature. But when asked for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["R", 
    RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[Nu]"}]}]], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"10ae4705-3527-4d15-b977-76413bcaed26"],
 "\[LongDash]the Ricci tensor, the final binding spell\[LongDash]the dragon \
awakens, roars, and breathes fire. The resulting equations are monstrosities. \
A single component, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["R", 
    RowBox[{"r", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "r"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "23acc205-864c-46a4-9ea5-0a8815b691f3"],
 ", swells to hundreds of terms. This is the thorny thicket of algebra with \
no obvious opening to simplification."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979303195387826*^9, {3.979303362914062*^9, 3.979303494120122*^9}, {
   3.97930358669457*^9, 3.979303655783993*^9}, {3.97931299706106*^9, 
   3.979313002088965*^9}, {3.9794322361234426`*^9, 3.979432290966332*^9}, {
   3.979462180333972*^9, 3.979462204117961*^9}, 3.9794623794784527`*^9},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"ad447c5f-b906-44cc-b088-f187bbd4e49b"],

Cell["\<\
We have found the dragon, but we cannot slay it and cannot step through the \
thicket around him. The equations are too dense, too coupled, and too angry \
to yield a solution by force. We need a better plan. We need the Wizard\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Map and the Magical Sword.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979303195387826*^9, {3.979303362914062*^9, 3.979303494120122*^9}, {
   3.97930358669457*^9, 3.979303672023635*^9}, {3.979304994380231*^9, 
   3.9793050251150923`*^9}, {3.979305815701075*^9, 3.979305819943542*^9}, {
   3.979462225104897*^9, 3.979462225467342*^9}},
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"2ab89c65-a8b4-418f-87e8-943b7d7d2947"],

Cell["\<\
Here is how we got the thicket in the first place\[LongDash]our first attempt \
at finding a metric for a spinning black hole:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979432322483536*^9, 3.9794323347975817`*^9}, {
  3.9794622349030313`*^9, 3.9794622478978252`*^9}, {3.979462298437529*^9, 
  3.979462337712874*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"76421ca4-e604-4d0c-a7d1-\
c3df1e9aa1db"],

Cell["Set up ansatz for a stationary, axisymmetric metric. ", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9791436597586727`*^9, 3.979143669135954*^9}, {
  3.979143801219017*^9, 3.979143825463798*^9}, {3.979143989447298*^9, 
  3.979143998420302*^9}, {3.9791441514584427`*^9, 3.979144191411241*^9}, {
  3.97914423164991*^9, 
  3.979144257095866*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d888724f-3175-43ea-a349-\
490906884dcd"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Write ",
 StyleBox["vacuum field equations",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Ricci", "=", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e16f5157-376d-4722-8bdd-d8633df7dfac"],
 ",  via \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9791436597586727`*^9, 3.979143669135954*^9}, {
  3.979143801219017*^9, 3.979143825463798*^9}, {3.979143989447298*^9, 
  3.979143998420302*^9}, {3.9791441514584427`*^9, 3.979144191411241*^9}, {
  3.97914423164991*^9, 3.9791442648527946`*^9}, {3.9791455316056004`*^9, 
  3.97914553334009*^9}, {3.979166076859174*^9, 3.979166092256649*^9}, {
  3.979166377094778*^9, 
  3.9791663777532578`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c8a5b21c-fe80-4984-b7ca-\
228da8dc99d1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Sub-strategy: Calculate Ricci components from toolkit functions ",
 StyleBox["ChristoffelsFromMetric", "Input"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["CalculateRiemannComponent", "Input"],
 "."
}], "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979145538372375*^9, 
  3.9791456244987717`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"25d9e8fe-da12-4f31-884a-\
4914c1c315b5"],

Cell["\<\
Unlike Schwarzschild, find that the Ricci equations are unwieldy: it\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s not at all clear how to drive Wolfram to produce a \
result. \
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9791436597586727`*^9, 3.979143669135954*^9}, {
  3.979143801219017*^9, 3.979143825463798*^9}, {3.979143989447298*^9, 
  3.979143998420302*^9}, {3.9791441514584427`*^9, 3.979144191411241*^9}, {
  3.97914423164991*^9, 3.97914424091224*^9}, {3.979145648738201*^9, 
  3.97914566072571*^9}, {3.979166390601845*^9, 3.979166394156747*^9}, {
  3.979296312183251*^9, 
  3.9792963401604853`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3e8e2582-2526-48bf-9412-\
5b14a6fab84b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Symbolically demonstrate Newtonian gravitation and mild gravitomagnetism in \
the weak-field limit, when the orbiting star is far from the black hole.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979143670929165*^9, 3.979143690470038*^9}, {
  3.979145665521387*^9, 3.979145671743224*^9}, {3.979166111963113*^9, 
  3.97916615752911*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"28e2984c-0465-4c7e-95d6-\
6e9f6fceb83d"],

Cell["\<\
Follow a historical derivation of the full solution: the Ernst Equation.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979143701054797*^9, 3.979143711056622*^9}, {
  3.979143790179283*^9, 3.9791437979215508`*^9}, {3.9791442746268578`*^9, 
  3.979144276952072*^9}, {3.9791661660779743`*^9, 
  3.979166170311262*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"05bcf0ff-9690-4782-b01d-\
3d1bc53e9930"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Stationary Axisymmetric Ansatz", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979076299057115*^9, 3.9790763104272614`*^9}, {
  3.979115005651691*^9, 3.979115006507614*^9}, {3.979144295140707*^9, 
  3.979144296103713*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"939b8d69-2e26-48d9-821e-\
1f8f20a000da"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"coords", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"t", ",", "r", ",", "\[Theta]", ",", "\[Phi]"}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979074333501361*^9, 3.979074333503202*^9}, {
   3.979074382141273*^9, 3.97907438830672*^9}, {3.979074421606793*^9, 
   3.979074590520749*^9}, {3.979074638210091*^9, 3.979074709815413*^9}, {
   3.9790749742263727`*^9, 3.9790751588520517`*^9}, {3.979075195429298*^9, 
   3.979075219218081*^9}, {3.979075258653852*^9, 3.9790752734725657`*^9}, {
   3.979075337625022*^9, 3.979075451712229*^9}, {3.979075843337785*^9, 
   3.979075867526464*^9}, {3.979075901585245*^9, 3.979075915205324*^9}, {
   3.979114269443429*^9, 3.97911427346502*^9}, 3.979114306960217*^9, {
   3.979114622518231*^9, 3.979114631991427*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[76]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c5fe3cdb-6fba-4096-af4e-14a5aa515cbc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Set up unknown functions of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["r", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bebd85b5-d2ff-4a74-aaf8-1ee5dfe7faf3"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Theta]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "89b28be5-5297-4582-ab7a-45eb6a88bc11"],
 " only, meaning of \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]stationary and axisymmetric,\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] i.e., doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t depend on time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["t", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "40d25dfc-36bc-4073-9728-a1f74fb135de"],
 " or azimuth ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Phi]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6eb7bf2-5e0f-4d39-a1ef-f73d2c9ec07d"],
 ". Assume we can find coordinate functions ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["r", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "74846cf0-aa2e-45b8-aa0e-88e8e4c2584c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Theta]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "315a6116-6c6b-42f3-b17d-4e7d2f8b7038"],
 " where the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"r", "\[LongDash]", "\[Theta]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "deaaa7c8-82ee-42e8-aea4-d90e88c3b2af"],
 " sector is diagonal (",
 StyleBox["Boyer-Lindquist coordinates",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "; see References)"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142660099052*^9, 3.979142720126712*^9}, {
  3.9791431029857388`*^9, 3.979143150977558*^9}, {3.979218945398583*^9, 
  3.979219019891932*^9}, {3.9792963826761513`*^9, 3.979296385071342*^9}, {
  3.9792964154431973`*^9, 
  3.979296431575163*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8eb3c58d-6693-4c6d-babd-\
c1b4c47fd561"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"A", "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fa48f1b0-f82d-4544-b982-c9b7a5503e94"],
 ": time potential"
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142736207567*^9, 3.9791427706892548`*^9}, 
   3.979142807965845*^9},ExpressionUUID->"6c154191-afce-4ea9-ade5-\
cdc8d8cb4a61"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"B", "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0b80035b-e5e3-4635-89a5-8bab97756da5"],
 ": radial metric"
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142773857553*^9, 
  3.979142805956254*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eedd9007-360b-435f-8657-\
838bf15a5290"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"C", "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "16bfdaa0-cf21-44c8-9b61-d12197ce86e0"],
 ": latitudinal metric"
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142793470028*^9, 3.979142803320108*^9}, {
  3.979142846066306*^9, 3.979142848783473*^9}, {3.979143061493477*^9, 
  3.9791430757626963`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6af26259-0dde-42e9-86fe-\
3edb9b26b6f4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"D", "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7de8a53e-e110-458a-9bd7-6c416b1ee064"],
 ": azimuthal, metric "
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142825314642*^9, 3.97914287674907*^9}, {
  3.979143053490081*^9, 3.979143057196856*^9}, {3.97914316747575*^9, 
  3.979143179588978*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"17ae1b14-5715-42bf-af97-\
127c280b74dd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"E", "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bf213acf-61be-427e-a14f-ef39da2be110"],
 ": rotational ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"t", "\[LongDash]", "\[Phi]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3d041ade-5ee6-4905-8c28-69d5c00a071a"],
 " coupling / frame-dragging, the signature component of Kerr over \
Schwarzschild."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142879762005*^9, 3.9791429012055187`*^9}, {
  3.979143185905388*^9, 3.9791432034524403`*^9}, {3.9791661933016977`*^9, 
  3.9791662093984118`*^9}, {3.9792194128718967`*^9, 
  3.9792194175465517`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"061a5755-9c40-488c-8246-\
7102d14b2d90"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Keep an eye on ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["E", "rot"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"8d630710-9cc7-45f7-8546-3cc9da961ae9"],
 StyleBox[".",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979166220151958*^9, 
  3.979166227171844*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"de2d795e-d8ab-4369-8b50-\
4fff818d56f8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Pick convenient names because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["C", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8c038fd1-1e70-46bc-9711-8513391aa8ce"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["D", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c5bb9057-65b8-4899-baea-c0cf1440830f"],
 " are reserved by Wolfram and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["E", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "97a7522c-b525-4026-a899-3bb6c469bcd1"],
 " is ambiguous"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979142915246376*^9, 3.97914296548112*^9}, {
  3.979143595019453*^9, 3.9791436213696823`*^9}, {3.9791662388670473`*^9, 
  3.9791662438236647`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"407448b4-a698-4bcf-a99f-\
329229627ebc"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"params", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Ak", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Bk", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Ck", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Dk", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Erot", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "\[Theta]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979074333501361*^9, 3.979074333503202*^9}, {
   3.979074382141273*^9, 3.97907438830672*^9}, {3.979074421606793*^9, 
   3.979074590520749*^9}, {3.979074638210091*^9, 3.979074709815413*^9}, {
